        "### Target value counts"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "FwSkKZlGu9sG"
      },
      "id": "FwSkKZlGu9sG"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "NOTE: the ‘target’ column indicates a successful transaction (‘1’) or a no-transaction (‘0’). Verify these are the only values in that column, and that there are no nulls."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "WjrYK1V2w-0e"
