    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "cbdc4672",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "cbdc4672"
      },
      "source": [
        "## Data Cleaning\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Backup #1"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "2MSnBhtzHeik"
      },
      "id": "2MSnBhtzHeik"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# backup copy of the original data\n",
        "transaction_df_backup= transaction_df.copy()\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "55y5KzhYHuss"
      },
      "id": "55y5KzhYHuss",
      "execution_count": 16,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# restore from backup\n",
        "transaction_df=transaction_df_backup.copy()"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "qecL3fCFH1qP"
      },
      "id": "qecL3fCFH1qP",
      "execution_count": 17,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Keep only the target and features"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "qUIv_kpkILBl"
      },
      "id": "qUIv_kpkILBl"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Selected `target` for the target and `var_0 through var_4` for the features"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "Yn1tTSqRIrgH"
      },
      "id": "Yn1tTSqRIrgH"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# select the target (first 1000 rows)\n",
        "transaction_df_target=transaction_df[['target']].head(1000).copy()\n",
        "transaction_df_target.shape"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "esBw2-hkIolV",
        "outputId": "14c5ed01-b08b-47c9-a0d4-e92f22248a51"
      },
      "id": "esBw2-hkIolV",
      "execution_count": 18,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "execute_result",
          "data": {
            "text/plain": [
              "(1000, 1)"
            ]
          },
          "metadata": {},
          "execution_count": 18
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# select the features\n",
        "feature_cols =[] #start with an empty list to hold the features\n",
        "for col in transaction_df.columns: #look at each column name\n",
        "  if col.startswith ('var_'): #if the name start with 'var_, it's a feature\n",
        "    feature_cols.append(col)\n",
        "# check the list (show 50 names)\n",
        "print(feature_cols)\n",
        "print(len(feature_cols))"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "collapsed": true,
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "AHVqHXdGL2gU",
        "outputId": "d34b05b7-6032-4ba8-cf90-9ed6a8f6f841"
      },
      "id": "AHVqHXdGL2gU",
      "execution_count": 19,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "['var_0', 'var_1', 'var_2', 'var_3', 'var_4', 'var_5', 'var_6', 'var_7', 'var_8', 'var_9', 'var_10', 'var_11', 'var_12', 'var_13', 'var_14', 'var_15', 'var_16', 'var_17', 'var_18', 'var_19', 'var_20', 'var_21', 'var_22', 'var_23', 'var_24', 'var_25', 'var_26', 'var_27', 'var_28', 'var_29', 'var_30', 'var_31', 'var_32', 'var_33', 'var_34', 'var_35', 'var_36', 'var_37', 'var_38', 'var_39', 'var_40', 'var_41', 'var_42', 'var_43', 'var_44', 'var_45', 'var_46', 'var_47', 'var_48', 'var_49']\n",
            "50\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# select the target and the features\n",
        "feature_cols= feature_cols[0:5] #keep only the first 5 feature (var0 to var4)\n",
        "\n",
        "#keep only the first 1000 rows,\n",
        "transaction_df_target_feature = transaction_df[['target'] + feature_cols].head(1000).copy()\n",
        "\n",
        "transaction_df_target_feature.shape #verify\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "H4On7uHEN5hm",
        "outputId": "d6c16f0f-02a3-44e7-ece8-ee0f5ab42d77"
      },
      "id": "H4On7uHEN5hm",
      "execution_count": 20,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "execute_result",
          "data": {
            "text/plain": [
              "(1000, 6)"
            ]
          },
          "metadata": {},
          "execution_count": 20
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Recommendations for Data Cleaning\n",
        "\n",
        "**1. Identifier Columns**\n",
        "- **Two columns:** `Unnamed: 0` is row numbers and `ID_code` is customer ID. cannot help predict anything\n",
        "- **Recommendation:** Drop both columns. (I kept only `target` and `var_0` to `var_4`.)\n",
        "\n",
        "**2. Null values:** No feature column have nulls. no action needed\n",
        "\n",
        "**3. Target nulls:** none, no rows dropped\n",
        "\n",
        "**4. Feature columns with high null counts:** None\n",
        "\n",
        "**5. Medium null counts:** none\n",
        "\n",
        "**6. Low null counts:** none\n",
        "\n",
        "**7. Null rows:** none\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "_tP358dmTWxU"
      },
      "id": "_tP358dmTWxU"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Exploratory Data Analysis ##"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "Ws78K_6ATWlC"
      },
      "id": "Ws78K_6ATWlC"
    },
